/Title (Deadline for project completion: 25.02.2024 Total budget available for the project: $200,000 A clear and authentic description of the entity's public image: An affordable fashion brand for every consumer. A detailed and personalized communication strategy to improve the public image: Communicating through various social media platforms, online banners, and advertisements that will include the company's key messages, which will attract more customers. Relevant and attractive communication materials for the target audience: Advertisements, social media posts, posters, etc. An effective approach for managing and strengthening the public image in the future: Rapid crisis management, transparency.)
